<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Petrify</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 30)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast petrify &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast petrify</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A spell to be reckoned with: the caster grasps their head in their hands 
and wills the target's flesh to turn to stone. It hurts a great deal: the 
better your divine power and your mind sphere, the more. It does best 
against clothes and somewhat less against leather, chain and plate, and a 
shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Anyone it slays leaves no corpse but a life-like <b>statue</b>, with 
everything they carried turned to stone with them. Nothing can be taken 
from a statue until its stone is undone: a successful <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Magic</a> 
cast on it unmerges the equipment, and then it can be looted like a 
corpse. Like a corpse, a statue cracks and crumbles away in time.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Corpse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Druid Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>